1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,010
D2.

2
00:00:02,010 --> 00:00:07,255
Read Vicky's article about her favourite season.

3
00:00:07,255 --> 00:00:10,100
I love winter.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,170
Winter is my favourite season.

5
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:19,480
It is very cold and everyone has to wear thick, warm clothes.

6
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:23,880
But I always enjoy winter here in Harbin.

7
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:28,770
During this season you cannot see colourful flowers.

8
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:35,150
The temperature is usually below zero and it is often snowy.

9
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:39,210
Everything is covered in deep white snow.

10
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:42,910
Even the lakes and rivers are frozen.

11
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:46,540
The land is quiet and beautiful.

12
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:51,220
My friends and I love to have big snowball fights.

13
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:56,320
We throw snowballs at each other, running and laughing.

14
00:00:56,320 --> 00:01:01,630
We also make snowmen and use carrots for their noses.

15
00:01:01,630 --> 00:01:03,680
They look funny.

16
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:09,340
Moreover, I enjoy the ice and snow festival each year.

17
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:13,290
There are beautiful ice sculptures everywhere.

18
00:01:13,290 --> 00:01:20,720
Winter in Harbin is really great and there are many fun activities to do.

19
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:22,530
I love winter.
